{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42409","headline":"贻耀州将 · 锺谟","name":"贻耀州将","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"翩翩归尽塞垣鸿，隐隐惊开蛰户虫。\n渭北离愁春色里，江南家事战尘中。\n还同逐客纫兰佩，谁听缧囚奏土风。\n多谢贤侯振吾道，免令搔首泣途穷。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"锺谟","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_42409.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42409","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}